Romacs's icons: the glyphs in this directory (*.svg), the codepoint list
(codepoints.txt) and the provenance list (sources.txt).

Each *.svg but romacs.svg is an upstream glyph, scaled and placed in one text cell by
tools/import-icon-glyphs from Symbols Nerd Font Mono 3.4.0
(Nerd Fonts, https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts). That font is
Copyright (c) 2014, Ryan L McIntyre (https://ryanlmcintyre.com) and is
licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1; Romacs Icons is a Modified
Version of it under the same licence (../fonts/OFL.txt). sources.txt names
every icon's upstream glyph and its set; each set's licence applies to its
glyphs too:

  md      Material Design Icons (Pictogrammers, https://pictogrammers.com),
          icons outside its Brand / Logos category: Apache License 2.0
          (LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt).
  dev     Devicon 2.16.0, as Nerd Fonts assembles it (https://devicon.dev):
          MIT, Copyright (c) 2015 konpa.
  oct     Octicons (https://github.com/primer/octicons): MIT,
          Copyright (c) 2023 GitHub Inc.
  custom  Nerd Fonts' own glyphs: MIT, Copyright (c) 2014 Ryan L McIntyre.

romacs.svg is Romacs's own: the R of the Romacs mark
(crates/romacs-display-runtime/assets/window-icon.svg), part of Romacs
and offered in this font under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 as well.

