The codepoint list, the provenance list and the scripts are Romacs's,
under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or (at your option) any
later version (see COPYING).

Romacs Icons (RomacsIcons.ttf) is built from the glyphs by
crates/romacs-icon-font, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
(../fonts/OFL.txt), its glyphs under their sets' licences above as well.
